    "vendor": "MOD Team",
    "version": "9.26",
    "doc": "A standard mono chorus with optional feedback. The parameter range suits subtle effects as well as all-out flanging. Modifying the delay time t when feedback is active will cause audible 'zipper' noise. source: http://quitte.de/dsp/caps.html#ChorusI",
